{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（18日）重陽節，當局預計昨日起的3日連假會出現人流高峰，經新皇崗口岸過關人次每日逾10萬。</p><p>保安局「口岸通」網站顯示，截至今日下午2時，出境大堂內繁忙，香港居民平均須輪候30分鐘，訪港旅客平均輪候約45分鐘。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:18:57.766264+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T07:30:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:34.560034+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T08:17:33.607573+00:00","content_hash":"1744c0b122a411fb88f3b82673cfe0c2b4638c8fec262aa3e960938bb7342eb6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}